flowchart TB
  subgraph laptop [Your laptop]
    A[Ansible playbooks]
    D[Docker]
    H[Host ports 3307 / 3001 / 9091]
  end

  A -->|kind create cluster| D

  subgraph kind [kind cluster: mysql-lab]
    CP[control-plane]
    W1[worker]
    W2[worker]

    subgraph ns_my [namespace: mysql]
      OP[Percona ps-operator]
      ORC[Orchestrator]
      HAP[HAProxy]
      M0[MySQL source]
      M1[MySQL replica]
      XB[XtraBackup jobs]
      MINIO[MinIO]
    end

    subgraph ns_mon [namespace: monitoring]
      PROM[Prometheus]
      GRAF[Grafana]
    end
  end

  HAP --> M0
  HAP --> M1
  M1 -->|GTID binlog stream| M0
  ORC -->|health + promotion| M0
  ORC --> M1
  XB --> MINIO
  PROM -->|mysqld_exporter :9104| M0
  PROM --> M1
  H --> CP
